Cost calculation direction

Once the metrics are properly prepared, our controller can evaluate links/path conditions using:

$$ Cost = w_DD_N + w_JJ_N + w_LL_N + w_UU_N $$

where _N means normalized, because we cannot sensibly add something like 20 ms + 5% + 7 Mbps directly.

